# Keep internal material out of the published sdist.
#
# setuptools' default sdist sweeps in top-level files and the test tree, so
# plan.md, weekly_report.md and tests/ shipped in every release through 0.9.0.
# Wheels were never affected; this is about the source archive.
prune tests
prune plans
prune templates
prune test-env-310
exclude plan.md
exclude weekly_report.md
exclude .env.example
exclude .secrets.baseline
exclude .secret-patterns.md
exclude CLAUDE.md
